  "notes": "Three copies of the same pinout: top view with two castellated rows and bottom view (silkscreen ESP32-C6-Zero) with an inner column of 7 labeled pads. The castellated edges in the bottom view are unlabeled there and duplicate the top-view pads, so they are not repeated. Category-only tags (UART, PWM, I2S, ADC, I2C, SPI) omitted; the BOOT tag on GP9 kept. Legend 'WS2812 RGB LED used pin GP8 DIN' is not tied to a pad and is noted here only."
